{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00708","headline":"郊庙歌辞 仪坤庙乐章 永和 · 祝钦明","name":"郊庙歌辞 仪坤庙乐章 永和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"閟宫实实，清庙微微。\n降格无象，馨香有依。\n式昭纂庆，方融嗣徽。\n明禋是享，神保聿归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"祝钦明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}